<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov C/A deficit $53 mln vs $20 mln in Oct.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov C/A deficit $53 mln vs $20 mln in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit widened to $53 million in November from $20 million in October, figures released by the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) on Wednesday showed.</p>
<p>The deficit was also $53 million in November 1995, it said.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY C/A BALANCE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    NOV 96   OCT 96    JAN-NOV 96     JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>    -53	-20	 -1,177	   -2,209</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
